;THE AUTHORS STATE THAT THIS PROTEIN IS DESIGNED TO MIMIC THE STATE OF FIMA SUBUNIT IN A
CHAIN. THIS PROTEIN (FIMA) POLYMERIZES INTO A CHAIN IN E.COLI VIA A DOMAIN SWAPPING MECHANISM. EACH SUBUNIT DONATES ITS N-TERMINAL RESIDUES TO THE PRECEDING SUBUNIT TO COMPLEMENT ITS FOLD, WHICH OTHERWISE LACKS ONE BETA-STRAND.
